{"screen_name": "shiba_musubi", "file": "shiba_musubi", "name": "柴結び(shiba.musubi)", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1647961253363478532/SEoFE6Bu.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/952899281224196096/1614577038/1500x500", "description": "音楽を作ります。 Audiostock：http://audiostock.jp/artists/34081/ Skeb : http://skeb.jp/@shiba_musubi March 10, 2026 Working on: 4 requests Awaiting approval: 0", "total_works": 187, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T13:59:00.671621+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T13:59:00.671621+00:00", "price_history": {"music": [{"amount": 8000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T13:59:00.671621+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"music": 8000}, "price_range": {"music": {"min": 8000, "max": 8000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/shiba_musubi", "name": "shiba_musubi"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "http://audiostock.jp/artists/34081/", "name": ""}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@shiba_musubi/works/187", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1647961253363478532%2FSEoFE6Bu.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4116248a08d9f735b67b99a3061f0d19", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1647961253363478532%2FSEoFE6Bu.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4116248a08d9f735b67b99a3061f0d19, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1647961253363478532%2FSEoFE6Bu.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c02c01297284eb70688573307c529945 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1647961253363478532%2FSEoFE6Bu.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6bae617bd9ac533b3f77a1b19755384d 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！オリジナルキャラクター／VTuberのBGM制作についてご相談です。彼は異次元の隙間に存在する静かな図書館兼宿屋を発見し、以来ずっとそこに留まっています。時折訪れる人々が彼の気分を明るくしますが、彼らは次第に消え去り、再び彼を独りにします。\n\nファンタジー風のメロディーを希望しますが、笑顔の裏に潜む悲しみをほのめかすような音楽にしたいです。テンポは中程度、遅すぎないものが理想的です。ピアノと弦楽器の音が特に大好きです。また、昔木琴とマリンバを演奏していたので、それらの楽器の音には安心感を覚えます。\n\nキャラクター資料と、彼に合うと思う楽曲を添付します。https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dgmVK0ldoA0ご検討いただきありがとうございます！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JaCZLZiNdaNfnSfxHYvKFlS3EpXKXN-A?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@shiba_musubi/works/186", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1647961253363478532%2FSEoFE6Bu.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7e8298b08b63cb555572fe1ec752470d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1647961253363478532%2FSEoFE6Bu.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7e8298b08b63cb555572fe1ec752470d, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1647961253363478532%2FSEoFE6Bu.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=523ec3e1a388ecb85d6ed15550045360 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1647961253363478532%2FSEoFE6Bu.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=341abbc8425bdf8670d9f30307f926d6 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@shiba_musubi/works/185", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3